  "about": [
    "The single source of truth for vienna-districts besides the two Stadt Wien files (tools/README.md): the 23 districts and the water drawn on the map.",
    "districts: number (BEZNR) and the official name; build_map.py checks each name against the source's NAMEK. Region ids are d01 … d23.",
    "water: which water of Realnutzungskartierung 2024 (CODE 241) is drawn. Pieces closer than 20 m form a body (a river cut by footbridges, a weir); a body is drawn if one of these seed points (EPSG:31256, metres) lies in one of its pieces. Wider bridges split a river into several bodies, each with its own seed; the overlay's stroke closes those gaps on the page. A seed outside all water, or two seeds in one body, stops the build."
